{"id":"yurist","lemma":"юрист","pos":"noun","rank":2627,"glosses":["lawyer","advocate"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/Ru-%D1%8E%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82.ogg/Ru-%D1%8E%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"юриста","plural":"юристы"},"examples":[{"text":"Кто ваш юрист?","en":"Who is your lawyer?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"your, yours"},null]},{"text":"Том говорит, у него нет юриста.","en":"Tom says he doesn't have a lawyer.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null]},{"text":"Тому нужен хороший юрист.","en":"Tom needs a good lawyer.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"good, nice, fine"},null]},{"text":"Мужчина, которого я встретил, - юрист.","en":"The man I met is a lawyer.","words":[{"g":"man"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретить"},null]},{"text":"Мы уже наняли юриста.","en":"We've already hired a lawyer.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"to hire, to engage","l":"нанять"},null]}]}